{"ref":"BDB, נָחָשׁ²","hw":"נָחָשׁ²","html":"† II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">נָחָשׁ</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  king of Ammon <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 11:1\" href=\"/I_Samuel.11.1\">1 S 11:1</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 11:2\" href=\"/I_Samuel.11.2\">2</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 12:12\" href=\"/I_Samuel.12.12\">12:12</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 10:2\" href=\"/II_Samuel.10.2\">2 S 10:2</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 19:1\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.19.1\">1 Ch 19:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 19:2\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.19.2\">2</a>; perhaps also <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 17:27\" href=\"/II_Samuel.17.27\">2 S 17:27</a>; 𝔊 Ναας.<br><strong>2.</strong>  father of Abigail and Zeruiah <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 17:25\" href=\"/II_Samuel.17.25\">2 S 17:25</a>, si vera l.; 𝔊 Ναας, but 𝔊L Ιεσσαι (cf. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:16\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.16\">1 Ch 2:16</a>); We<sup>Gesch. 2, 57 Anm. 1</sup> Löhr defend <span dir=\"rtl\">נחשׁ</span>; dub. We<sup>Sm</sup> HPS.<br><strong>3.</strong>  giving name to a city <span dir=\"rtl\">עִיר נ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:12\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.12\">1 Ch 4:12</a>, 𝔊 πόλεως Ναας; 𝔊L Ηρναας.","next":"BDB, נַחְשׁוֹן","prev":"BDB, נָחָשׁ"}